<title>USA: SFX gets early antitrust clearance.</title>
<headline>SFX gets early antitrust clearance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>SFX Broadcasting Inc said on Thursday that it has received early termination of the waiting period under the Hart-Scott-Rodino Antitrust Improvements Act for the company's acquisition of Multi-Market Radio.</p>
<p>The company expects the $12.00 a share acquisition of Multi-Market to close within the first two weeks of October, SFX said.</p>
<p>SFX also said that it has closed on the $3.5 million acquisition of WSTZ(FM) and WZRX(AM) in the Jackson, Miss., market.</p>
</text>
